Description: Scalable Performance Measurement Infrastructure for Parallel Codes (gnu15 + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 The Score-P measurement infrastructure is a highly scalable and easy-to-use
 tool suite for profiling, event trace recording, and online analysis of HPC
 applications.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
